22:38:37 [----]   - Bring me a fruit that makes your face scrunch!
22:38:37 [----]   - Find something chefs squeeze on fish!
22:38:37 [----]   - I'm looking for an oval yellow fruit!
22:38:37 [----] Generate exactly 3 DIFFERENT inference-style requests for EACH target that let the child figure out THAT target without naming it.
